 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "If you give a mushroom robot legs,",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.95,
   "show": 0.0,
   "hide": 1.92
  },
  {
   "text": "it can actually walk.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 1.96,
   "end": 3.24,
   "show": 1.92,
   "hide": 3.39
  },
  {
   "text": "Scientists grew living fungus",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 3.43,
   "end": 5.05,
   "show": 3.39,
   "hide": 5.015
  },
  {
   "text": "into a robot's electronics.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 5.055,
   "end": 6.49,
   "show": 5.015,
   "hide": 6.65
  },
  {
   "text": "And every time the fungus fired",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 6.69,
   "end": 8.1,
   "show": 6.65,
   "hide": 8.07
  },
  {
   "text": "an electrical signal...",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 8.11,
   "end": 9.16,
   "show": 8.07,
   "hide": 9.47
  },
  {
   "text": "The robot moved.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 9.51,
   "end": 10.51,
   "show": 9.47,
   "hide": 10.73
  },
  {
   "text": "But here's where it gets weird.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 10.77,
   "end": 12.24,
   "show": 10.73,
   "hide": 12.38
  },
  {
   "text": "They shined ultraviolet light on the fungus.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 12.42,
   "end": 14.55,
   "show": 12.38,
   "hide": 14.7
  },
  {
   "text": "And the robot changed how it walked.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 14.74,
   "end": 16.37,
   "show": 14.7,
   "hide": 16.52
  },
  {
   "text": "So this thing has no brain.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 16.56,
   "end": 18.38,
   "show": 16.52,
   "hide": 18.54
  },
  {
   "text": "No eyes.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 18.58,
   "end": 19.21,
   "show": 18.54,
   "hide": 19.35
  },
  {
   "text": "And absolutely no idea",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 19.39,
   "end": 20.93,
   "show": 19.35,
   "hide": 20.9
  },
  {
   "text": "where it's going.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 20.94,
   "end": 21.63,
   "show": 20.9,
   "hide": 21.86
  },
  {
   "text": "But the mushroom is literally",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 21.9,
   "end": 23.36,
   "show": 21.86,
   "hide": 23.325
  },
  {
   "text": "controlling its legs.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 23.365,
   "end": 24.59,
   "show": 23.325,
   "hide": 24.74
  },
  {
   "text": "Which means scientists basically",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 24.78,
   "end": 26.36,
   "show": 24.74,
   "hide": 26.325
  },
  {
   "text": "gave a fungus a body.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 26.365,
   "end": 27.77,
   "show": 26.325,
   "hide": 28.333
  }
 ],
